        "original_id": "efbe0832-01b9-5f77-b449-f2f50d78d82a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Fisk, Wilson Fisk, Vanessa Fisk, Stan Lee, John Romita Sr.\n- Characters: Kingpin\n- Companies: Marvel Comics\n- Publications: The Amazing Spider-Man #50\n- Topics: family relationships, character roles, character creation\n\nFacts:\n- Kingpin is the fictional supervillain identity of Wilson Fisk in American comic books published by Marvel Comics.\n- Stan Lee and John Romita Sr. created Kingpin, who first appeared in The Amazing Spider-Man #50 with a cover date of July 1967.\n- Richard Fisk is the son of Wilson Fisk, also known as Kingpin, and Vanessa Fisk.\n- Richard Fisk was originally a villain and later became an antihero.",
